iption": "Use your knightly reflexes and magic sword art to fend off never ending and ever increasing numbers of enemy balls! These bouncy baddies will have you overwhelmed in no time if not nimble and alert.\n\nImbue your sword, flail and polearm with the souls of your enemies then point it to the sky and watch your foes disappear in a crack of thunder. Will you continue to hold the title of hero in this once peaceful town?\n\nCompete to get your score on top of the leader boards!", "short_description": "Using your magic weapons, defend your town against hordes of horseback riding bouncing balls."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://developerjoel.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Developer Joel", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://developerjoel.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "CASUAL", "ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1086546292139507"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974713_268028409547975_6505584675295302245_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PFDqzPOBlEsQ7kNvwEoKgcB&_nc_oc=AdpHit1Er8fjUZxOV5aZ-LPqJQ3GcB_7-HlnJITm7AkoWEp2qDhnAat9kwrweBrdY-Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRwErcy4TbqherNbGaBqHmkGl_ndwVov92uIwD7